"diagram theming" is a notebook page
	<header level="1">
		Diagram
		<header>Boxes in columns and the links between them:  a NERD, an ERD, any boxes-and-lines picture, drawn by the NERD skill's rules.</>
	</>

	<!-- THEMING:  the family's tokens, live, plus how to set them and which themes touch it. -->
	<section label="Tokens">
		<markdown>
			Set a public `--ui-*` token on the element, any ancestor or `:root`; it inherits into the shadow
			root. Edit a value below to try it.
		</>
		<html>
			<ui-docs-tokens family="ui-diagram" playground>
				<ui-diagram remember="example-recipe-box">
					<ui-json>&#123; "columns": \[ &#123; "groups": \[ &#123; "label": "Recipe Box", "color": "#047857", "lanes": \[ \[ &#123; "name": "Recipe", "note": "One dish, written down", "gap_before": 50, "fields": \[ "cuisine", "tags\[]", "method", "photos\[]", "notes\[]", "adapted_from", "replaces", "related_recipes\[]" ] &#125; ], \[ &#123; "name": "Cuisine", "note": "e.g. Thai, Basque" &#125;, &#123; "name": "Tag", "note": "Quick, vegetarian, spicy" &#125;, &#123; "name": "Method", "note": "Varies by cuisine", "fields": \["technique", "timer"] &#125;, &#123; "name": "Photo", "note": "Kept by a photo host", "fields": \["host / photo_id"] &#125;, &#123; "name": "Note", "note": "A cook's remark" &#125; ] ] &#125; ] &#125;, &#123; "groups": \[ &#123; "legend": true &#125;, &#123; "label": "Elsewhere", "color": "#6b7280", "gap_before": 60, "nodes": \[ &#123; "name": "Technique", "note": "Kitchen guide", "color": "#7c3aed" &#125;, &#123; "name": "Timer", "note": "Kitchen guide", "color": "#7c3aed" &#125;, &#123; "name": "Photo hosts", "note": "Outside services" &#125; ] &#125; ] &#125; ], "edges": \[ &#123; "from": "Recipe.cuisine", "to": "Cuisine" &#125;, &#123; "from": "Recipe.tags\[]", "to": "Tag" &#125;, &#123; "from": "Recipe.method", "to": "Method", "kind": "contains" &#125;, &#123; "from": "Recipe.photos\[]", "to": "Photo", "kind": "contains" &#125;, &#123; "from": "Recipe.notes\[]", "to": "Note", "kind": "contains" &#125;, &#123; "from": "Recipe.adapted_from", "to": "Recipe" &#125;, &#123; "from": "Recipe.replaces", "to": "Recipe" &#125;, &#123; "from": "Recipe.related_recipes\[]", "to": "Recipe" &#125;, &#123; "from": "Method.technique", "to": "Technique" &#125;, &#123; "from": "Method.timer", "to": "Timer" &#125;, &#123; "from": "Photo.host / photo_id", "to": "Photo hosts" &#125; ] &#125;</>
				</>
			</>
		</>
	</>

	<section label="Themes">
		<markdown>
			The theme menu above picks the theme for every page of the site:  Spell, Glass, Fruity or Merlot,
			each restyling this component through its tokens.  The spec's own colours (headers, groups) stay;  the page, box bodies, text and lines follow the theme and dark mode.
		</>
	</>
